WEBVTT

00:00:00.687 --> 00:00:03.534
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There were four tests for me to complete in Madrid.

00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:09.160
I had to order a drink and a sandwich in a bar, ask the price, and understand it.

00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:13.111
Then I had to ask for directions in the street, and follow them,

00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:19.769
then get a taxi to a famous place, and finally, phone somebody and leave a message on their voicemail.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:22.260
There were just three rules.

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:28.032
You mustn’t use a dictionary or phrase book app, you must only speak Spanish,

00:00:28.519 --> 00:00:32.073
and you mustn’t use your hands or mime, or write anything down.